    "Id": "chassisdef_pack_hunter_ii_PHII-4",
    "Name": "Pack Hunter II",
    "Details": "This version of the Pack Hunter II was introduced during in 3093.[9] The B-Pods and ER medium lasers have been removed, leaving it with only the single ER PPC, but in place of secondary weapons, each arm and leg has been equipped with an actuator enhancement system.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
